1. Remove the tty1 autologin override:
sudo rm -rf /etc/systemd/system/getty@tty1.service.d
sudo systemctl daemon-reexec

2. Remove the gatekeeper trigger from root's bash profile:
sudo nano /root/.bash_profile

Delete the block you added:
if [ "$(tty)" = "/dev/tty1" ]; then
    /usr/local/bin/gatekeeper.sh
fi
Save and exit (Ctrl+O, Enter, Ctrl+X).

3. Re-enable lightdm to autostart normally:
sudo systemctl enable lightdm
Optional cleanup — remove the script itself:
sudo rm /usr/local/bin/gatekeeper.sh
